    "k-always": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "CHICO (GTA6DOG), STFD (StonkFoundry) and PANDU (Pandu Pandas) share only the word always ('always finds a way to steal', 'always pointing up', 'always by your side'). No common story. CHICO's GTA VI-character metadata belongs to a different story than the GTA 6 Dacity Coin narrative (recorded in candidates); a checker account (e2:0) calls its volume wash trading."
    },
    "k-belief": {
      "decision": "deferred",
      "reason": "Something ('They said pump coins are backed by nothing but belief. We turned that into Something.') and the two Backed By Belief (Nothing) coins answer a hearing remark that Pump.fun coins are 'backed by nothing but belief' (e3:0; a checker account says it was a House hearing, not the Senate as promoters say). Combined $8.2M volume, but only two coins meet the member bars (the second Nothing pool has a $62K market cap) and the only sources are promoter and checker posts, no news or official record. STFD ('Built on belief') shares only the word. Re-evaluate once a hearing record or news report and a third coin appear."
    },
    "k-anytime": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "INVERSE ('close anytime'), PANDU ('always by your side') and RAID (RaidLords) share only the word anytime. No common story."
    },
    "k-tokenized": {
      "decision": "rejected",
      "reason": "SODI (private leverage for tokenized stocks), UDTF (a dividend-fund meme) and RAETO (tokenized stocks pay for AI inference) share only the word tokenized. RAETO belongs to the AI inference markets narrative (resumed today); SODI and UDTF are recorded in candidates."
    },
    "k-fund": {
      "decision": "deferred",
      "reason": "UDTF, USDF and the unflagged USOE coin are the oil and dividend fund family, now seven days old; ENVAR (an agent services marketplace) shares only the word. The family has $2.1M of unflagged volume across three coins but no independent source: the e5:1 search returned only a post calling a fund-named coin 'a memecoin wearing a fund name' and airdrop-claim spam, and most of the family's pools carry implausible market caps or 24h moves (quarantined)."
    },
